    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021B1C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2cdecec17678becda1369349f83df090820a31036eb20f7fc2e74090bd2d7c88",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Actually,[ctrl:FFA3] a\n[red]gold rare Tama thief[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021B48",
      "source_words_sha256": "a28261d61ecacb60ecbd284de2dd9877716e6d3c2300499ac04747030eb9a6bf",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Sure, a baseless rumor.\f[ctrl:FFA3]But even a lie's true\nto those who believe it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021BA8",
      "source_words_sha256": "f87fb9c181a4736363f1495f439b0d75fd468b037449e61809d27831f77aefd1",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Shut up, Sougo.\nOr [ctrl:FFA2]slit your belly!\f[ctrl:FFA3]Anyway, some idiot\nbelieved that rumor.\f[ctrl:FFA3]He's stealing Gin Tama\nall over Edo.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021C34",
      "source_words_sha256": "f300657090cdc026a790b687a5dbc9dcb45f421bc7012ab1c91fd9723e61c0ff",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Then we [ctrl:FFA2]heard you\ntalking about it.\f[ctrl:FFA3]Thought you might\nknow the [red]Tama thief[/color]...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021CA8",
      "source_words_sha256": "6cbf87744c248312ea8687459a8e4572dd50c715c85ff6517d2b97a71aba4226",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Sadly, yes.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021CC0",
      "source_words_sha256": "4609fa577edc6d0ef182709b8f7182cf7574cf1185cdf8f446ef1ad675ac6c55",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Total lie!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021CD4",
      "source_words_sha256": "74dcd8f8228379a27def8ed55ed907953bebc09618bb9588dc49d6da0f67033e",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Seven grant\na wish, yes?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021D04",
      "source_words_sha256": "25c52cc6a0b69bc11d7cb7bcf4850e9c77ac1650e5585f4322f7bd15c4cdca80",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]Who believes\nthat nonsense, yes?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021D38",
      "source_words_sha256": "eee9c390add3080b81600613d6885effbe75a350eaa99fb534382329ef56db3c",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Hm?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021D44",
      "source_words_sha256": "d3ebdfefb6dad52fbfc8be4a385ad6f8f2dac04cf2da9d44c87563fd3bcd960a",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Hijikata, you wimp.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021D68",
      "source_words_sha256": "59952c544158f02367f6b2bc5599d285ab4b649477d8b4b265a511d201911c88",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Know the gold\nrare Tama rumor?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021D90",
      "source_words_sha256": "ca33016d0b88a2ae9f06da1fd10daac5a5d4a375fdafb2ac4fc9944d3e48a895",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]There's one\nright here.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021DB0",
      "source_words_sha256": "e6246e44aab52f06ec9eba9015b36b534225ec8892a8264075aee0300c4d4496",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Seems you're\nnot involved.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021DE0",
      "source_words_sha256": "9668bf3eb69226746a0f76716873caf0c40df09443cc5c087455590556d1b457",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]Sorry to take\nyour time, sir.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021E10",
      "source_words_sha256": "c12be69eda09744175012b276915f0b7102c23769dbe68e16726bc9e85d086b9",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA1]You forgot?!\nIt's Shinpachi[ctrl:FFA1]! Shinpachi!\f[ctrl:FFA3]Oh, never mind.\f[ctrl:FFA2]Why are the fearsome\nShinsengumi investigating\nGin Tama, anyway?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021EA4",
      "source_words_sha256": "f122746ba2beb81b6a78c6589b0147a2e96feb81331e4bf93c26b5af054c332c",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA2]A Tama thief?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021EBC",
      "source_words_sha256": "8b74f3916c088f38b3f38627809327c12d62e0462c057df4b0e11eb075a2fdf0",
      "english": "[ctrl:FFA3]That happened...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00021EDC",
      "source_words_sha256": "53716bd63c62ed77bd56e1a554cad7a11914e98862fabc10731c912e216a01aa",
      "english": "Ugh, my chronic cramps...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000220AC",
      "source_words_sha256": "f454b252acdccf3d32d5382d719c11cd03516d80a0f9ccdcfe28065aafbbae42",
      "english": "Tch. Dragon Tama\nrumors are surely\njust baseless nonsense.\fBut even a lie's true\nto those who believe it.\fSomeone's stealing\nGin Tama all over Edo.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00022398",
      "source_words_sha256": "c4c9e99e622ceea3880355926154f1b30cee894005744f47cf965cdde4b1316f",
      "english": "Never mind, eh?\fSounds like they're\nnot linked to the thief.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000223E8",
      "source_words_sha256": "6036dc3d6c8ceb8463138f85038e26f61ec85151d9faf08ac5ae6ab675223033",
      "english": "Seems you're\nnot involved.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00022414",
      "source_words_sha256": "1f36db690b965b5cf1ebc74da976ae86d9bb4309c09fdd7e051d0dac82f58cc0",
      "english": "Sorry to take\nyour time, sir.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00022550",
      "source_words_sha256": "030b2dc928347f87c7a9b42bee294ec82c085a876b576eea7d6dca08833b3667",
      "english": "A gold rare Tama thief?!\fSo you're all\nlooking for him.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000227A8",
      "source_words_sha256": "4ff0e45545601002bb11db6d760740e6e2a4f06cd5eb1a8f06574e95bd8d1f90",
      "english": "...Fine. For today.\fSorry to bother you...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000227EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "94ad6062cdada4b73e60a88377a4a10d2bd65de58c2ac9d424fa61a0939c7786",
      "english": "Hey! Too soft!\nSearch him!\fAny Dragon Tama?\nConfiscate them now!\fTake him to [blue]HQ[/color]\nfor torture...!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002289C",
      "source_words_sha256": "8d2fcf02a53257f7351b30a002415e9a60fb8af6d979442961f539d74f7eaf60",
      "english": "Kondo, we're going.\f...See you, sir.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000228D4",
      "source_words_sha256": "6189a822c562933d485740009a2964bba1a3f78e7bcd3f1050acb544f27e7b64",
      "english": "Walked all day.\nNothing much to show.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00022924",
      "source_words_sha256": "0bff643057695a6bd331e375771c54933f2b2872c3f51701408b23d849910cec",
      "english": "Stopped caring.\fI'll get an ulcer\nif I keep worrying.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00022AA4",
      "source_words_sha256": "af27e769a092c7ae04193a17eaa22f8feb8b917528c1467f1d7ce8fa4736052f",
      "english": "That seller's\na tricky one.\f...He's an Amanto.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00022AE8",
      "source_words_sha256": "80eb31e7a115c0543f0ed04cf7d85b9b750e48c1d719023ab11d193c8f436c12",
      "english": "A big name\nin the adult\nentertainment trade, too.\fArrested for something\nonce. Heard he was\nreleased right away.\fBefore that, he planned\na big chain of high-cut\nleotard shabu-shabu places.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00022BB4",
      "source_words_sha256": "5adf5a71fa5ffb63950c94ee3da877f5f641add112c2e96b9e55788ffadc2f90",
      "english": "Must have\nthe right connections.\f...Leave it, Sougo.\fArrest him without proof\nand it'll be trouble.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00022C7C",
      "source_words_sha256": "ae608e5e003890ddb3d724c4903195596162ab866bb2e844b775722197a077f7",
      "english": "Shut up! Hold it\nor wet yourself!\nYour choice!\fWe're going, Sougo!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00022EB0",
      "source_words_sha256": "cf5a754cacec17764860b08276d2ee3f941425636bd65b403b8517316da61063",
      "english": "Luckily, no one's here.\nWhy not do it\nround there?\fBetter than peeing\nin the middle of town.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023088",
      "source_words_sha256": "dc26131182aa55b00836ffe8fcbe3f0c316ef9395b5babab99424b1b1e2a3b75",
      "english": "Released so fast...\nConnections high up\nin the authorities?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000230E8",
      "source_words_sha256": "34c1926cb6cde8b655363b41caf85aedef13224dfec8e81b14ce588aedf41f30",
      "english": "Just wet yourself\non the way back.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023148",
      "source_words_sha256": "c2add879b949fd49d744885a192c145ba34abf0246947d1279b7b87a72f8b4a3",
      "english": "Sougo, restrain Kondo.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000231A8",
      "source_words_sha256": "27f5da93f59946834b11d773d200b5e7a31a0b30899fd37d0810b9c6be42f2a1",
      "english": "Good, Sougo.\fKeep holding him down.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000231F8",
      "source_words_sha256": "56b0d6d2ffb37635bec59ba70f8f86b3b75814781459c09c898c37308a3cf1e0",
      "english": "A report? What of?\nThat Tama thief?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023220",
      "source_words_sha256": "3810c37c6927de8b8262b839e23b7e90e8240433739e4504efb531209d67c1a7",
      "english": "No? Then what\nhappened to them...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002324C",
      "source_words_sha256": "c9f2e8c356e404c06da08a27fff29337f926f0a44e7fb9e407c989469bb3f7cc",
      "english": "What? Fraud?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023470",
      "source_words_sha256": "766429fdf35ce42d0227cb0cf533c317017a7dae2f6cc2c738ee69bd0ded48cc",
      "english": "Why leave out 'Chief'?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023554",
      "source_words_sha256": "4fc1defeb45eda0150f24aedc687f50b971e52ff4f42f4249b43a7ce7f88e2c7",
      "english": "About time\nfor a wash, wasn't it?\fSmelled pretty bad.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023718",
      "source_words_sha256": "50bdb7f731a98ac052e676245fef61a21cf1906cbb7ff3f7de63ad3f059d3f36",
      "english": "...We have a [red]suspect[/color]!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023748",
      "source_words_sha256": "8883e8c020d4e34baad069459aa92ef26858bc9bb7dcd058a6de8080d42db5b9",
      "english": "Yes. A Dragon Tama\ncollector filed a report!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023790",
      "source_words_sha256": "a71575209f1b7331d7aba63233c6780b7369a51301aace5786c7c7307f2ab82d",
      "english": "...[red]Fraud[/color].",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000237F0",
      "source_words_sha256": "0135de741ac190e7d18dcacb128bcea8550a31db582a093b832d6b345e6c2bda",
      "english": "The Tama they bought\nwas a total fake!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023828",
      "source_words_sha256": "47b651d03200886cdb7533b967dbb8dfc38c60a90714b0d1eee357eb0315c830",
      "english": "Just an ordinary\nGin Tama painted gold!\nA blatant fake!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023878",
      "source_words_sha256": "d7bc6f312144c1c854c0a1ed2e1c45bc884fd9aa68db6bd60bfdae9af7ce0169",
      "english": "Investigating turned up\nseveral similar cases.\fOnly circumstantial\nevidence so far. But if\nwe get a confession...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002393C",
      "source_words_sha256": "3e93049ec215b65402406e4fcf2914ad3217cd8a8b0c0ef3b348534a9c3ad35a",
      "english": "That's the tricky part...\f...Seems he's an Amanto.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023990",
      "source_words_sha256": "d7124ca414fb593485e1cce2dbed67e8a5ec4f5375cd95d4ec34bbb808fe1519",
      "english": "Look.\fA sketch based on\nthe victim's account.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000239D0",
      "source_words_sha256": "21b733827e303a017e2f8c282bb2cf9c9dd8b36eb73143fa4e321bc7f95075f8",
      "english": "Yes. About the fake\nDragon Tama deals...\fWe know the\napproximate times.\fEvery other day,\nat dusk and late at night,\nin the same spot.\fBut the spot changes\nfrom day to day...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023B04",
      "source_words_sha256": "db1121173cad68c88fc70cdc0b77da959d2d1a9051de1aaecad2e24488397fbd",
      "english": "Rude to gorillas!\nApologize!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023BC4",
      "source_words_sha256": "fa93597ced92b3490a08e915c1576d98ed1eaf9d0633eeae79437fc1eafb5d6b",
      "english": "Kondo! Don't rush!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023DD4",
      "source_words_sha256": "518caf219a6afd11071036123f6e0cda48b8362f1502d96903430bc10e36520e",
      "english": "Freeze! Shinsengumi!\fYou're under arrest\nfor serial Gin Tama theft\nand fake Dragon Tama fraud!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00023F74",
      "source_words_sha256": "fbbe55c0f1ff5a6186a5d99e2a2d41d737ed576be4a85ca603f39b1313fad30e",
      "english": "Out of my way!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000240E0",
      "source_words_sha256": "38ffeb5be758e4d2afd6c06ec60dac1a7d3a3deac0f0f5806e74848aaed25f41",
      "english": "Just teach him\na little lesson.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024198",
      "source_words_sha256": "d1cab82633b5bb1b00f5bbd22e11a11d159ab6831539dfe2673bb014ecc9071f",
      "english": "...Personal grudge, eh.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000241C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "f9c97d15bd14cab7e075cf75e0c98aa5e95777cea18c1b4af2e9fe625b5b54e4",
      "english": "Didn't someone just\nrun past? Extremely fast...\fWas I imagining it...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024274",
      "source_words_sha256": "e1e9e3c373f70698c9f8c67af767afa5424d79f25305f37a02420a483d93329f",
      "english": "Well, sir, in a hurry.\nExcuse me!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024458",
      "source_words_sha256": "b265e8209ceab15067c309a56508ade405246b0f640dd9ca821ab2a388d9c419",
      "english": "Who cares about\na crook's problems?!\nResist and you're arrested!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024564",
      "source_words_sha256": "eef2dfda5b29ad2abc246ea6c8f6c83163cfd44e5cc40686b96874f10352304d",
      "english": "If that's how it is,\nI'm a man too!\fLet's have a fair\nGin Tama battle!\fI win, you let me go!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000245F4",
      "source_words_sha256": "d2a13c53392f72ea8ddc834df6f7f34b9f91e539c1bb6b8aca340cc88d02ca7a",
      "english": "Come on! A fair fight!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024630",
      "source_words_sha256": "e2f4eebc4717f49a0a51b3d8bce94262d3a92f20ff9905d86477db78fa1a9508",
      "english": "Not doing it for fun.\fUsed to guard\nan embassy.\fSome idiot threw a bomb\nin there. I let him escape\nand got fired!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000246D0",
      "source_words_sha256": "bf7440abb2bc6235f7c2f443765a84ee327c714f3bd6af36cc39d78007892956",
      "english": "Can't be picky now.\nThief's henchman or not,\nI'll do anything to eat!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024760",
      "source_words_sha256": "78a7e759f2c2435bc8ffe5ea120495c4b9d5d2e3a80c61b329f0cba16d99b693",
      "english": "Sounds familiar...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024788",
      "source_words_sha256": "83dac196d4829ed6b69fca8e91f4b1b121a35d80168e438405faa20bfae3d4e2",
      "english": "Logic won't work, Hijikata.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000247D8",
      "source_words_sha256": "92b9009f591aa58a0a9618b8b33b2f21f1966dfee3a503fc9e71d1d01b7311d2",
      "english": "No! Arrest him!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000247F8",
      "source_words_sha256": "b650bd0a38dadcfe321b736cbe05967c67a2ccdfddf2916fad772e3546cf579d",
      "english": "I said from the start...\nCounterfeit fraud!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024868",
      "source_words_sha256": "783aa50f20c3547902bbcfcc4ff53def20cc5db639062ce359bb3d2b2c732382",
      "english": "...From your neck?\nThere's nothing there.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000248BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "88fe141ce5948229fef7bbc7602dc11515e717fa26d6d49e191e6184228b01ba",
      "english": "...Why such\na petty scam, anyway?\fYou just got released.\nWon't be so lucky\nas a repeat offender.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0002493C",
      "source_words_sha256": "187588679d490e22b0e1c9e6c46ca18bf9360f3dd88e88054fdb596f58f73710",
      "english": "Last trick?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024968",
      "source_words_sha256": "7cb4d47fd9176ad97f99b614466e78a7f8cb7314055a1f317d4ecfdaeca8e656",
      "english": "...So, a nasty, sloppy\ntheft-and-fraud scheme\nafter all.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024AEC",
      "source_words_sha256": "625c059ff67216b9cd3a984e42f45a821258431e12dbd76e84920e465ecd9df6",
      "english": "Tired...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00024BA4",
      "source_words_sha256": "a9988593c4590fad6bce5dd05742e901f531efd28f1ebe310ede26e9ad542a11",
      "english": "And HE'S in charge\nof this case...",
      "translator_note": null
    }
  ]
}
